there where 2 machine check messages in a row on the console
and each had a "CPUID=1" in the message.   The machine now
would crash on boot, so I pulled CPU 1, and it's up and running.

Oh, and it had the 0x670 vector message.  So it finally failed
hard and told me which CPU to pull.   I've got a replacement
on order.

